%% SignalR Real-Time Communication Flow
%% Multi-device synchronization via WebSocket

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device1 as 📱 Device 1<br/>(MAUI)
    participant Device2 as 💻 Device 2<br/>(Web)
    participant Hub as 📡 SignalR Hub<br/>/hubs/board
    participant Notifier as 🔔 BoardChangeNotifier
    participant API as 🔌 Board API
    participant DB as 🐘 PostgreSQL

    Note over Device1,DB: Connection Establishment
    
    Device1->>Hub: Connect with JWT
    Hub->>Hub: AuthenticateUserId()
    Hub->>Hub: AddToGroup("board-user:{userId}")
    Hub-->>Device1: Connection Established
    
    Device2->>Hub: Connect with Cookie
    Hub->>Hub: AuthenticateUserId()
    Hub->>Hub: AddToGroup("board-user:{userId}")
    Hub-->>Device2: Connection Established
    
    Note over Device1,DB: Mutation Flow
    
    Device2->>API: POST /api/board/dailies/{id}/complete
    API->>DB: UPDATE BoardItems
    API->>DB: INSERT UserActivityEvents
    API->>Notifier: NotifyBoardChangedAsync(userId)
    
    Notifier->>Hub: Clients.Group("board-user:{userId}")
              .SendAsync("BoardChanged")
    
    Hub->>Device1: BoardChanged event
    Hub->>Device2: BoardChanged event
    
    Device1->>Device1: Refresh from SQLite/local
    Device2->>Device2: Refresh from server
    
    Note over Device1,DB: Settings Change Propagation
    
    Device1->>API: PUT /api/user/settings
    API->>DB: UPDATE UserNotificationSettings
    API->>Notifier: NotifySettingsChangedAsync(userId)
    
    Notifier->>Hub: Clients.Group("board-user:{userId}")
              .SendAsync("SettingsChanged")
    
    Hub->>Device1: SettingsChanged event
    Hub->>Device2: SettingsChanged event
    
    Note over Device1,DB: Disconnection Handling
    
    Device1->>Hub: Disconnect (app closed)
    Hub->>Hub: OnDisconnectedAsync
    Hub->>Hub: RemoveFromGroup("board-user:{userId}")
    
    Note right of Hub: Reconnection Logic:
    Device1 will auto-reconnect
    with exponential backoff
    and replay missed events

    %% Styling
    Note right of Device1: Client-side handling:
    - Reconnect with backoff
    - Buffer mutations during disconnect
    - Replay on reconnection
